OL,3,GNEWSABoy takes on run challenge for
OL,4,Ateacher with cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teacher with breast cancer has
OL,7,Fdescribed her pupil as "my hero" after
OL,8,Fhe embarked on sponsored runs to help
OL,9,Fher.
OL,11,FMolly Andrews, a Year 5 teacher, says
OL,12,F11-year-old Max, from Bingham in
OL,13,FNottinghamshire, is the one who has
OL,14,Fkept her going after her diagnosis.
OL,16,FMax has raised #3,000 to pay towards
OL,17,FMolly's living expenses while she
OL,18,Fundergoes treatment.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
