OL,3,GNEWSABoy takes on run challenge for
OL,4,Ateacher with cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe has run 4km (2.5 miles) a day with
OL,7,Ffriends and well-wishers throughout
OL,8,FAugust, finishing with a final jog this
OL,9,Fweekend near his home with as many of
OL,10,Fhis supporters as possible there to
OL,11,Fcheer him on.
